
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NACOS | Veritas University</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f7fc;
            color: #222;
        }

        header {
            background: #071b49;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px 7%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        header h2 {
            color: #fff;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #071b49, #1265bd);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 17px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #ffc107;
            color: #071b49;
            padding: 13px 25px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        section {
            padding: 65px 8%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        section h2 {
            color: #071b49;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 28px;
        }

        section p {
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 12px #00000012;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #1265bd;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .contact {
            background: #e5edf9;
        }

        footer {
            background: #071b49;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        @media(max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 15px;
            }

            nav {
                text-align: center;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 29px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h2>NACOS</h2>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#activities">Activities</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="home">
    <h1>Welcome to NACOS</h1>
    <p>
        Nigerian Association of Computing Students<br>
        Veritas University Chapter
    </p>
    <a href="#about" class="btn">Discover More</a>
</div>

<section id="about">
    <h2>About NACOS</h2>
    <p>
        NACOS is an association that brings computing
        students together to learn, grow and explore
        opportunities in technology and innovation.

        This website is a student project created for
        the Veritas University Chapter.
    </p>
</section>

<section id="activities">
    <h2>Our Activities</h2>

    <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Technology</h3>
            <p>Exploring modern technology and digital skills.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Workshops</h3>
            <p>Learning through practical training and demonstrations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Innovation</h3>
            <p>Encouraging creativity and problem-solving.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
        Interested in learning more about NACOS?
        Connect with the association through its
        official university channels.
    </p>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 NACOS Veritas University Chapter</p>
    <p>Built by a Computing Student</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
